; C++ (ECIL v1, slice S3): temporaries with cleanups in the initializer of a
; global (the ctor region of a cir.global: allocas and cleanup scopes inside
; it, a flag-guarded conditional cleanup) and of a function-local static (the
; ctor region of a cir.local_init), and a thread-local static local.
; RUN: cat %S/Inputs/header08_cxx.txt %s > %t.txt
; RUN: %ecil-asm %t.txt -o %t.ecil
; RUN: %edg-cir --emit=cir %t.ecil | %FileCheck %s
; RUN: %edg-cir --emit=obj -o %t.o %t.ecil
; RUN: gcc %t.o -o %t.exe
; RUN: %t.exe

